{
  "$description": "Pennant's values, the one source the build writes tokens/tokens.css, the mode sheets, and the option sheets from. Each token key is the CSS custom property name without its leading dashes. A club's two colors are four tokens: color 1 is color-neutral with color-neutral-content on it, and color 2 is color-secondary with color-secondary-content on it. Every other color derives from them by a color-mix(), so a colors value or a club's override recolors the whole theme. Edit here and run scripts/theme/build-tokens.mjs.",
